@startuml seq_4_messaging
title Flow 4 – Direct Messaging (Request -> Accept -> Chat)

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1A237E
    ActorBorderColor #1565C0
    ActorBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #4527A0
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    DatabaseBorderColor #2E7D32
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    LifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FC
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    NoteBorderColor #F9A825
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

actor       "User A (Sender)"    as sender
actor       "User B (Recipient)" as recipient
participant "Blazor Server"      as blazor
database    "PostgreSQL"         as pg

== Sender initiates a message request ==

sender  ->  blazor  : Visit /user/{userId} — click "Message"
blazor  ->  pg      : SELECT Conversations WHERE\n(initiatorId=A AND recipientId=B)\nOR (initiatorId=B AND recipientId=A)
pg      --> blazor  : No existing conversation

note over blazor : No conversation exists;\nshow compose box inline

sender  ->  blazor  : Type message body + click "Send Request"
blazor  ->  pg      : INSERT Conversation\n(initiatorId=A, recipientId=B,\nstatus=Pending)
blazor  ->  pg      : INSERT DirectMessage\n(conversationId, senderId=A, body)
pg      --> blazor  : Saved
blazor  --> sender  : Redirect to /inbox/{conversationId}

note over sender : Sees "Waiting for User B\nto accept your request"

== Recipient views inbox and accepts ==

recipient ->  blazor  : Open /inbox
blazor    ->  pg      : SELECT Conversations WHERE\nrecipientId=B OR initiatorId=B\n(with Initiator, Recipient, Messages)
pg        --> blazor  : Return conversations list
blazor    --> recipient : Show pending request from User A\n(highlighted in Requests section)

recipient ->  blazor  : Click conversation card
blazor    ->  pg      : SELECT Conversation + Messages\nWHERE id = ?
pg        --> blazor  : Return conversation (Status=Pending)
blazor    --> recipient : Show request banner + initial message

alt Recipient accepts the request
    recipient ->  blazor  : Click "Accept"
    blazor    ->  pg      : UPDATE Conversation\nSET status = Accepted
    pg        --> blazor  : Saved
    blazor    ->  blazor  : BadgeNotifier.NotifyAsync()
    blazor    --> recipient : Show full chat view
end

alt Recipient declines the request
    recipient ->  blazor  : Click "Decline"
    blazor    ->  pg      : UPDATE Conversation\nSET status = Declined
    pg        --> blazor  : Saved
    blazor    ->  blazor  : BadgeNotifier.NotifyAsync()
    blazor    --> recipient : Redirect to /inbox
    note over sender : Sees "This message request\nwas declined" if they open the chat
end

== Ongoing conversation (both users can now message freely) ==

sender    ->  blazor  : Open /inbox/{conversationId}
blazor    ->  pg      : SELECT Conversation + Messages\nORDER BY SentAt ASC
pg        --> blazor  : Return accepted conversation + messages
blazor    --> sender  : Render full chat thread

sender    ->  blazor  : Type reply + press Send (or Enter)
blazor    ->  pg      : INSERT DirectMessage\n(conversationId, senderId=A, body, sentAt)
pg        --> blazor  : Saved
blazor    ->  pg      : Reload conversation messages
blazor    --> sender  : Append new bubble to chat

recipient ->  blazor  : Open /inbox/{conversationId}
blazor    ->  pg      : SELECT Conversation + Messages\nORDER BY SentAt ASC
pg        --> blazor  : Return full message history
blazor    --> recipient : Render full chat thread with all messages

@enduml
